Exact cost residuals are reported even when their commodity amounts could resemble an exchange.

========== API ==========

aggregate()

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity USD
  format 1,000.00 USD
commodity FUND
  format 1,000.000 FUND
account Assets:Fund
account Assets:Cash
account Assets:Other
2024-01-01 Incorrect unit cost
  Assets:Fund  1.234 FUND @ 2.00 SEK
  Assets:Cash  -2.48 SEK
2024-01-02 Mixed cost and exchange
  Assets:Fund  1 FUND @ 10 SEK
  Assets:Cash  -9 SEK
  Assets:Other  -1 USD

========== OUTPUT ==========

[
  {
    "account": "Assets:Cash",
    "commodity": "SEK",
    "quantity": "-11.48"
  },
  {
    "account": "Assets:Fund",
    "commodity": "FUND",
    "quantity": "2.234"
  },
  {
    "account": "Assets:Other",
    "commodity": "USD",
    "quantity": "-1"
  }
]

========== WARNINGS ==========

[MISSING_DEFAULT_COMMODITY] Journal must declare one default commodity
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:1:1

[UNBALANCED_TRANSACTION] Transaction does not balance: -0.012 SEK
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:10:1

[UNBALANCED_TRANSACTION] Transaction does not balance: 1 SEK, -1 USD
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:13:1
